{"4135090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JumpoCalypse", "steam_appid": 4135090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Jumpo survive the Jumpocalypse in this tight precision platformer where timing is everything. Leap through floating ruins as the world collapses around you in this high-octane challenge where each jump could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tight, satisfying jumps with perfect timing to navigate collapsing platforms and deadly hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrowly escape 4 apocalyptic environments packed with danger from every angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ handcrafted levels designed to test your precision and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mega-bounces, teleportation puzzles, freeze tokens, and the long-rumored triple jump (gasp!).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you jump your way through the Jumpocalypse and become the legend who out-jumped the end of the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of Celeste, Super Meat Boy, and any game that rewards crisp, precise platforming with a side of chaotic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to jump? The Jumpocalypse is here!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Jumpo survive the Jumpocalypse in this tight precision platformer where timing is everything. Leap through floating ruins as the world collapses around you in this high-octane challenge where each jump could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tight, satisfying jumps with perfect timing to navigate collapsing platforms and deadly hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrowly escape 4 a